From a6edf244ab78199f782904dcdb81b45b9913977c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 10:30:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): let a forced re-verification finish

Re-verifying with no cutoff kept every record a candidate, so deferred
never dropped below the per-run cap, and withheld rows were picked
again each run because their verified_at stayed old. A re-verification
now takes a cutoff time: only records verified before it are fetched,
withholding a record stamps verified_at, and repeated runs with the
same cutoff converge to deferred 0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FCgoUnzqQSfKjvqShB2hjh
